      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 6. (a) The Committee may establish procedures and other requirements with respect to requests for waivers of public bidding and general criteria for granting such waivers. The Committee may also direct particular contracting agencies to develop guidelines for public bidding any may review such guidelines and their application.",
