      "category": "Text",
      "text": "the project solicitation. Upon the award of a concession agreement, the deposits of the unsuccessful bidders shall be returned to them. The deposit of the successful bidder shall be returned to such bidder upon completion or termination of the agreement, provided that timely payments as prescribed by the agreement have been made by the successful bidder and it has complied with all the other terms and conditions of the agreement.",
